        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Pipit 1.0</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Voice-to-text transcription with local on-device processing</li>
                    <li>Support for 25 languages</li>
                    <li>Global hotkey for quick dictation</li>
                    <li>AI-powered text enhancement (optional)</li>
                    <li>Voice workflows for hands-free automation</li>
                    <li>Transcription history management</li>
                    <li>Auto-update support with Sparkle</li>
                    <li>Removed WhisperKit dependency for smaller app size</li>
                    <li>UI polish and improvements</li>
                    <li>Network monitoring enhancements</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
